{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TtJ1HRPHJ9bhzhFuZryuK2","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (360.7KB). Full output saved to: /Users/user/.claude/projects/-Users-user-work-delegate-13-contract/955b7c74-9c45-4512-b530-d243dea4139a/tool-results/b1yj0qf3m.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\ntitle:\tContract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\nlabels:\tready-for-agent\ncomments:\t1\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\tuser/delegate#12\nblocking:\tuser/delegate#15, user/delegate#14\nnumber:\t13\n--\n## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\nThe contract step: the CLI is the only interface, under the name `delegate`.\n\n- Remove the MCP server and everything only it used: the protocol loop, tool schemas, progress notifications, argument validation, the in-memory job registry, the old binary.\n- Remove the parity snapshot, the old reproduction spec, the July/August plans and specs, the code review notes, the multi-backend idea doc, and the Codex plugin manifest.\n- Host profile moves to `~/.config/delegate/` with the `DELEGATE_HOST_PROFILE` override; profile fields `promptPreamble`, `verifyCommands`, `requiredDeny`, `deadlineMs` are gone.\n- Status records live in `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/`.\n- Setup builds the release binary, installs `delegate` on PATH, and moves an existing old profile to the new location.\n- The Claude plugin is renamed to `delegate` and ships only the skill. Version 1.0.0. README rewritten for the CLI.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] No MCP code or old-name references remain outside git history.\n- [ ] Setup on this machine installs `delegate` on PATH and moves the old profile.\n- [ ] All tests, clippy and the format check pass.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #12 Latency and supervisor-memory budgets\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# delegate setup: build the CLI, install on PATH, migrate host profile, install the plugin.\n#   DRY_RUN=1 ./bin/setup.sh   # preview commands without making changes\nset -euo pipefail\n\nREPO_ROOT=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")/..\" && pwd)\"\nDRY_RUN=\"${DRY_RUN:-0}\"\n\nrun() {\n  if [ \"$DRY_RUN\" = \"1\" ]; then\n    echo \"DRY_RUN: $*\"\n  else\n    \"$@\"\n  fi\n}\n\nif ! command -v cargo >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"955b7c74-9c45-4512-b530-d243dea4139a","uuid":"fa5467f3-b0c6-4cde-8c27-88ba4fe7ee3b","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:09:12.199Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"title:\tContract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\nlabels:\tready-for-agent\ncomments:\t1\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\tuser/delegate#12\nblocking:\tuser/delegate#15, user/delegate#14\nnumber:\t13\n--\n## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\nThe contract step: the CLI is the only interface, under the name `delegate`.\n\n- Remove the MCP server and everything only it used: the protocol loop, tool schemas, progress notifications, argument validation, the in-memory job registry, the old binary.\n- Remove the parity snapshot, the old reproduction spec, the July/August plans and specs, the code review notes, the multi-backend idea doc, and the Codex plugin manifest.\n- Host profile moves to `~/.config/delegate/` with the `DELEGATE_HOST_PROFILE` override; profile fields `promptPreamble`, `verifyCommands`, `requiredDeny`, `deadlineMs` are gone.\n- Status records live in `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/`.\n- Setup builds the release binary, installs `delegate` on PATH, and moves an existing old profile to the new location.\n- The Claude plugin is renamed to `delegate` and ships only the skill. Version 1.0.0. README rewritten for the CLI.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] No MCP code or old-name references remain outside git history.\n- [ ] Setup on this machine installs `delegate` on PATH and moves the old profile.\n- [ ] All tests, clippy and the format check pass.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #12 Latency and supervisor-memory budgets\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# delegate setup: build the CLI, install on PATH, migrate host profile, install the plugin.\n#   DRY_RUN=1 ./bin/setup.sh   # preview commands without making changes\nset -euo pipefail\n\nREPO_ROOT=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")/..\" && pwd)\"\nDRY_RUN=\"${DRY_RUN:-0}\"\n\nrun() {\n  if [ \"$DRY_RUN\" = \"1\" ]; then\n    echo \"DRY_RUN: $*\"\n  else\n    \"$@\"\n  fi\n}\n\nif ! command -v cargo >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  echo \"ERROR: cargo not found on PATH. Install Rust (https://rustup.rs) first.\" >&2\n  exit 1\nfi\n\nif ! command -v cursor-agent >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  echo \"WARNING: cursor-agent not on PATH. Install it and run 'cursor-agent login' before write jobs.\" >&2\nfi\n\nTARGET_DIR=\"${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/delegate/target\"\nrun cargo build --release --manifest-path \"$REPO_ROOT/Cargo.toml\" --target-dir \"$TARGET_DIR\"\n\nINSTALL_BIN=\"$HOME/.local/bin/delegate\"\nrun mkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$INSTALL_BIN\")\"\nrun cp \"$TARGET_DIR/release/delegate\" \"$INSTALL_BIN\"\n\ncase \":${PATH}:\" in\n  *\":$HOME/.local/bin:\"*) ;;\n  *)\n    echo \"WARNING: $HOME/.local/bin is not on PATH. Add it to your shell profile.\" >&2\n    ;;\nesac\n\nCONFIG_HOME=\"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}\"\nOLD_PROFILE=\"$CONFIG_HOME/cursor-delegate/host-profile.json\"\nNEW_PROFILE=\"$CONFIG_HOME/delegate/host-profile.json\"\nif [ -f \"$NEW_PROFILE\" ] && [ -f \"$OLD_PROFILE\" ]; then\n  echo \"NOTE: host profile exists at both $OLD_PROFILE and $NEW_PROFILE; leaving both untouched.\"\nelif [ ! -f \"$NEW_PROFILE\" ] && [ -f \"$OLD_PROFILE\" ]; then\n  echo \"Migrating host profile to $NEW_PROFILE\"\n  run mkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$NEW_PROFILE\")\"\n  run mv \"$OLD_PROFILE\" \"$NEW_PROFILE\"\nfi\n\nif command -v claude >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  run claude plugin marketplace add \"$REPO_ROOT\" --scope user\n  run claude plugin install delegate@delegate --scope user\n  echo \"NOTE: remove a previous cursor-delegate install with: claude plugin uninstall cursor-delegate@cursor-delegate-local && claude plugin marketplace remove cursor-delegate-local\"\nelse\n  echo \"NOTE: 'claude' CLI not found. Install the plugin manually:\"\n  echo \"  claude plugin marketplace add $REPO_ROOT --scope user\"\n  echo \"  claude plugin install delegate@delegate --scope user\"\nfi\n\necho \"Done.\"\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://anthropic.com/claude-code/marketplace.schema.json\",\n  \"name\": \"delegate\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Local directory marketplace shipping the delegate CLI skill.\",\n  \"owner\": { \"name\": \"Amogh Akshintala\", \"email\": \"amogh.akshintala@databricks.com\" },\n  \"plugins\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"delegate\",\n      \"description\": \"Skill for orchestrating work through the delegate CLI.\",\n      \"source\": \".\",\n      \"category\": \"workflow\",\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"name\": \"delegate\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Routes tasks to cursor-agent, pi, or Claude Code models through the delegate CLI.\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"name\": \"Amogh Akshintala\",\n    \"email\": \"amogh.akshintala@databricks.com\"\n  },\n  \"skills\": [\n    \"./skills/delegate\"\n  ]\n}\n tests/fixtures/pi/tool-calls-fix.stdout            |  174 +++\n tests/live.rs                                      |  104 +-\n 148 files changed, 6587 insertions(+), 12986 deletions(-)\nbin/setup.sh:41:OLD_PROFILE=\"$CONFIG_HOME/cursor-delegate/host-profile.json\"\nbin/setup.sh:54:  echo \"NOTE: remove a previous cursor-delegate install with: claude plugin uninstall cursor-delegate@cursor-delegate-local && claude plugin marketplace remove cursor-delegate-local\"\n.gitignore:5:.mcp.json\ntests/fixtures/cursor/ponytail-19.stdout:47:{\"type\":\"tool_call