{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbQxsGA7r1QfFvUnGeYz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: CHANGES\n\n- P2 skills/delegate/SKILL.md:4,12,149,150,169 — Still says \"cursor-delegate\", and the documented status directory is `cursor-delegate-jobs`. The CLI now writes to `delegate-jobs`, so the documented `watch` and poll snippets read paths that don't exist. This breaks the criterion \"no old-name references remain\" and sends agents to the wrong files. The fix is to replace the name and path throughout the skill. Per #4, the skill's rewrite for the CLI may belong to #14, but the status directory path must be correct in this PR.\n- P3 tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-7.stdout (and others) — Recorded output contains `cursor-delegate`, `cursor-delegate-mcp`, `cursor-delegate-jobs`. Strictly this breaks the criterion. Fix by redacting via `scripts/redact.jq`, or record an explicit exemption for fixtures in the ruling.\n- P3 bin/setup.sh:44-49 — Migration leaves the empty `~/.config/cursor-delegate/` directory behind. Optionally `rmdir` it after the `mv`, which is harmless.\n- P3 src/config.rs:179 — The host profile still accepts `idleMs`. Ruling 2 and #13 don't list it for removal, so this is only worth confirming.\n\nsetup.sh is otherwise correct. The profile move is gated on the destination being absent, a note is printed when both exist, nothing happens when there's no old profile, and the plugin ids match. Running it on this machine is deferred by ruling 8.\n\nChecked, no findings: tests (132 plus the e2e suites) and clippy pass. Format check output was empty, so it passes. Nothing the CLI needs appears to have been deleted. The `DELEGATE_HOST_PROFILE` env var is wired in `src/config.rs` and used by the tests. No `mcp` strings remain beyond the documented cursor-agent wire names.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":610,"cache_read_input_tokens":44917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":610},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"955b7c74-9c45-4512-b530-d243dea4139a","uuid":"b02e541f-1f2c-42cf-9d20-1ddcef576e9c","timestamp":"2026-10-01T11:09:59.717Z","request_id":"req_011CfbQxrsMACsF2N6iR6ZBC"}
